1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,335
Multiply out the first few powers of a plus b, and watch.

2
00:00:04,335 --> 00:00:07,005
The power of a falls from n to zero.

3
00:00:07,005 --> 00:00:10,026
The power of b rises from zero to n.

4
00:00:10,026 --> 00:00:11,640
They always add to n.

5
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:20,611
And the coefficients, one two one, one three three one, one four six four one, are the rows of Pascal's triangle.

